rcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ffa46a09/uploads/origins/c17829b2-e66a-4d74-ad8f-17b6eb76c7a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e6132d69001e20badfcc7bcdaecd715a, https://si.imgix.net/ffa46a09/uploads/origins/c17829b2-e66a-4d74-ad8f-17b6eb76c7a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c74bda7388ab2b06e451640d7c731242 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffa46a09/uploads/origins/c17829b2-e66a-4d74-ad8f-17b6eb76c7a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9eb358f137212c5b02e5da4f4325f552 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I would like to request you draw my two characters. \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LdX6A1iyWGCnM5kSHkvWVAtZvX3C2Ivv?usp=sharing\n\nThe male character (blue hair) doesn't take many things seriously, and is laid back, but can be a little cheeky and possessive. The female character (purple hair) is cheerful , energetic and hopeful, and she blushes a lot, like a shoujo manga protagonist.\n\nFor the background, make it cute and pink, (maybe  with a bit of light blue) with sparkles and heart doodles.\n\nDraw a pose like this: \nhttps://tr.pinterest.com/pin/584201382904622718/\n\nI want to use it to promote my free game, perhaps using it as the title page. You will be provided with credit! https://tenshistudios.itch.io/exchange?secret=usqeDF0lUy8LUBTYlwiT6gbj0\n\nPlease include the PSD. Draw at around 4:3, landscape", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Eri_0917/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/066d26d9/uploads/origins/cc5036a5-e40f-4bb4-bb31-2baf2aed41fa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fb790a6e388982f59167752dac70d222", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/066d26d9/uploads/origins/cc5036a5-e40f-4bb4-bb3