"src": "https://si.imgix.net/06f15548/uploads/origins/58d48543-0061-43e0-82b1-b8ca08827802?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=291bab8044d4071b069b7f2424d5c22f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/06f15548/uploads/origins/58d48543-0061-43e0-82b1-b8ca08827802?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=291bab8044d4071b069b7f2424d5c22f, https://si.imgix.net/06f15548/uploads/origins/58d48543-0061-43e0-82b1-b8ca08827802?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c84c941faa3fe9fa7ca3e25305e68b6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/06f15548/uploads/origins/58d48543-0061-43e0-82b1-b8ca08827802?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ee34c3e514f888e2ad41b9d79a4ec187 3x"}, "body": "Hello Eri-san!\n\nI was hoping you could draw my Vtuber Character, Amiya. She is a sweet and sometimes mischievous spider girl. I would like you to draw her near a window sill, similar to any of the following works:\nhttps://safebooru.org/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=4076073\nhttps://safebooru.org/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=5374767\nhttps://safebooru.org/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=2795240\n\nPlease draw her wearing a flowy white dress, and with a kind, smiling facial expression. \nHere are some prompts for elements to add:\nFarmhouse decor\nBirds/Butterflies\nLace\nDoilies\nRibbons\n\nI will use this art for a song cover, so please draw it in 16:9 aspect ratio, and have the character and background elements on a separate layer. Please provide PSD and transparent PNG formats. Please note she has 4 fluffy spider legs. You can also optionally include her additional pair of eyes.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/19BTxIgoq25UAhS8Hk1M14x6U3koEqx1x", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Eri_0917/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1930589, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=430bf86e04c6255199c28ff585e2f89e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=430bf86e04c6255199c28ff585e2f89e, https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f3a2640b0a35317aeb54bab7569b250 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc3cfb093d4ead86e2a4d3a06f4671df 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aa658418258d6b7ff5a2ef4bf9f9413f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aa658418258d6b7ff5a2ef4bf9f9413f, https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c6a3c8b2005c173aab1c5968e2685ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e3e398f/uploads/origins/b28a11c0-7e4d-44d4-9f2a-4e287c149135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f02874b354d7e33aa3bf04e9e7ee1fc5 3x"}, "body": "Dear ERI,\n\nFirst time,\nI would like to ask you to illustrate Nyan-san for the first time.\nI would like to request an illustration of Nianyan.\nI would like to request an illustration of Nianyan.\n\nUsage\nSNS Icon and Twitter\nI will use it as a thumbnail for distribution (monetized). / Monetized Thumbnail Streams\nUsage on fansites / membership / Usage on fansites / membership content\n\nRequested Design\n\nYou can choose the original outfit and adjust it to fit the theme, or to dress her up in a date-outfit for winter.\nI would be happy if you could draw it in a 16:9 format.\n\nIllustrations I Like From You\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Eri_0917/works/5\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Eri_0917/works/8\n\nSomething similar to this illustration\nSomething similar to this illustration!\n\nOther Request & Deliverables\nI would appreciate it if you could separate the PSD (text, person, background).\nI would appreciate it if the head, hair, and hands could be uninterrupted.\n\nPlease separate the layers and send a PSD file.\nI would be happy if you could keep the head, hair and hands uninterrupted (not cut off by the canvas)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/gallery/MGoPeMf\n\nhttps://imgur.com/gallery/MGoPeMf", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Eri_0917/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1930589, "client_id": 3734709, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb085496/uploads/origins/43c200d4-c702-44a2-b2f5-fad63aca8d13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b895f69df3c828af5e347d965ab25dec", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eb085496/uploads/origins/43c200d4-c702-44a2-b2f5-fad63aca8d13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b895f69df3c828af5e347d965ab25dec, https://si.imgix.net/eb085496/uploads/origins/43c200d4-c702-44a2-b2f5-fad63aca8d13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e207327f640297f792412accf114ec5b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eb085496/uploads/origins/43c200d4-c702-44a2-b2f5-fad63aca