ation of my character Fera Lune. She is a werewolf moon goddess with a bright and energetic personality. She  has long blue hair that ends with a sparkly purple gradient and she has wolf ears and a fluffy tail. She ahs heterochromia, one eye is yellow and the other is blue.\n\nI want to request an illustration for art I can use for a Music Video (please adjust price as needed). I want to Cover Sanctuary by Utada Hikaru from Kingdom Hearts, so I would love an  image of Fera Lune on the Destiny Islands (or a beach) like Kairi. Examples provided here. \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YUI9FmFwjzFk2_LzhnmwDCtVBfN3FWaL?usp=sharing\n\nPlease make the illustration 16:9 and if possible, please separate the layers! Thank you so much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1-3iX1wPnWvu_17f8LtUm6FoJ49vmYBpp", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Eri_0917/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1930589, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a29f712a/uploads/origins/d0ff7159-02f5-4be4-9478-9811910c014d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d38ca4164bc913df99cc7bc63ebde5ac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a29f712a/uploads/origins/d0ff7159-02f5-4be4-9478-9811910c014d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d38ca4164bc913df99cc7bc63ebde5ac, https://si.imgix.net/a29f712a/uploads/origins/d0ff7159-02f5-4be4-9478-9811910c014d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bea3363fa65eba8b9f7ad5749338d351 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a29f712a/uploads/origins/d0ff7159-02f5-4be4-9478-9811910c014d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f5ba1cc76d8681514167795857218bf 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_ima