"private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1930589, "client_id": 2850616, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f359d9a3a1a379625eb681d3b2be53dd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f359d9a3a1a379625eb681d3b2be53dd, https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a94c89eb25deda21d5ca997a331f947d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83867074b0e5c263855517f236a163bd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7992b71afc35cfddd21f8af168ec55f6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7992b71afc35cfddd21f8af168ec55f6, https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=edb68aa6284fc6190843eea2e3958543 2x, https://si.imgix.net/866011f1/uploads/origins/2ec971ac-c946-4c2a-9db6-731a73f303bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dca9d45205def9db48ce2a36157e8138 3x"}, "body": "Dear ERI\n\nThis is my first time contacting you.\nI am contacting you because I would like to request you to create an illustration for me.\n\nWe have provided the details of your request below.\nIf your request is not currently accepted, please cancel it or submit a new request.\n\nDetails of your request\nWe would like to ask you to create an illustration to be used in a YouTube video I tried singing.\nThe song is \"Shigami-sama ni Nigai\" by Mafumafu.\nURL: https://youtu.be/rl1Yo3Zyw64?si=7-eXLSJaFcymzi3U\n\nPlease see below for a list of specific requests.\nWe would appreciate it if you would consider our request as long as it is not too much work for you.\n\nRegarding the composition: We would be honored if you could keep the world view and atmosphere of the original song while adding your own unique and original sensibility to the arrangement. We would like a slightly eerie atmosphere.\nColor: Please use cold or monotone colors throughout the image.\nMasks: We would like to see a mask somewhere in the illustration (e.g. a masked figure wearing a mask). (e.g., the mask is worn on the head, not on the face, etc.) We will leave the choice of expression up to you.\nExpression and eye color: We would appreciate it if you could draw the expression and facial features of the character without the mask, using your own ideas. Please use blue for the color of the eyes.\nRatio of illustration: Please use a ratio of 16:9.\n\n\nUsage\nThumbnails on YouTube, distribution, and use in video clips.\nPostings and announcements on SNS such as X (formerly Twitter)\nUse in other general VTuber activities\n\nAbout the data to be delivered\nIf possible, we would greatly appreciate it if you could provide us with the data in PSD format with separate layers for the person, background, and text. We would appreciate it if you could also separate the layers for people, backgrounds, and text, etc., if possible, in a PSD format.\n\nWe would be very happy if you could accept our proposal after considering the above information.\nWe would be more than happy if we could be of service to you.\nThank you very much for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CIGdZlqzpUOSynzE21vmH-3uprR0oSaR?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Eri_0917/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1930589, "client_id": 3445381, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7963072a7c9cf423767f7cc2946ef8f8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7963072a7c9cf423767f7cc2946ef8f8, https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54bdcc0dc18cefe92ca070b53102a546 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fc40df2d71c5ec99448d59d0104026b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=881eaace3c330893efd2b38eb47c0883", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=881eaace3c330893efd2b38eb47c0883, https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ab4d794f022cc7223627f8d3b28cd775 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c31744d9/uploads/origins/e37616ef-8ddf-4758-865a-a7ee9dc74aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86315e9b5b1c945269d51437c618f5b8 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would like to request a drawing of the vtuber parasi. Para is a carnivorous bunny girl -- she is cheerful, bratty and proud.  She can be hedonistic too, greatly enjoying meat, beer and tobacco. She has long blue hair, red spiral eyes, a flat chest, and has a large fluffy rabbit tail. Please draw her in any way that you would like, and feel free to change her outfit and hairstyle as well\n\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/hmv0yc\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/hmv0yc", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Eri_0917/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1930589, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/704fd88e/uploads/origins/8e08e5b3-78cd-47e3-a50c-7600f5ef2a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d614aad2d44121aab4a6f4a25a630a2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/704fd88e/uploads/origins/8e08e5b3-78cd-47e3-a50c-7600f5ef2a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d614aad2d44121aab4a6f4a25a630a2, https://si.imgix.net/704fd88e/uploads/origins/8e08e5b3-78cd-47e3-a50c-7600f5ef2a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d05162d6394df2766dc36fc007e86bfb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/704fd88e/uploads/origins/8e08e5b3-78cd-47e3-a50c-7600f5ef2a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03705aa58f63b6f1ba474239e44b47ee 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/704fd88e/uploads/origins/8e08e5b3-78cd-47e3-a50c-7600f5ef2a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blu